values ('compound', 'kum-POWND', 'verb', 'to increase or grow by adding smaller things over time', 'Small decisions compound into a life you recognize.', 'From Latin compunare, to put together.', 'Not the same as accumulate; compounding implies each addition grows the next.', array['accumulate','build','snowball'], array['Good habits compound - one workout becomes a year of fitness.'], (select id from articles where slug = 'learning-to-make-smaller-decisions'))
